flowchart LR
    E[Retrieved and grounded claims] --> S{Verification evidence standard}
    S -->|strict| G3{Identity + affiliation + research}
    S -->|identity_only_mvp| G1{Directly grounded identity}
    G3 -->|missing| P[Partially verified record]
    G3 -->|present| V[Verified Supervisor]
    G1 -->|missing| P
    G1 -->|present| MVC[Verified with concerns]
    MVC --> D[Affiliation and research gaps remain visible]
    D --> F{Fit-eligible evidence exists?}
    F -->|no| Z[Research Fit not established: 0 / LOW / explicit gaps]
    F -->|yes| R[Evidence-cited Research Fit]
    Z --> H{{Candidate review}}
    R --> H
    H -->|explicit approval only| L[Shortlisted Supervisor]
